            "review_text": "RheaCh\nSydney, Australia3 contributions\n0\nGood fresh food, attentive service\nJun 2014 • Friends\nFood was very tasty and fresh, good value for money. We had spring rolls, lime beef salad (was definitely the hands down winner), a squid meal and a tomato cucumber salad. Local beer available which was really good to see. Waiter was attentive, English wasn't great but was passable. Bathroom could use an upgrade for sure, western toilet but no auto flush.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 26, 2014",
