            "review_text": "Brian T\nAdelaide, Australia247 contributions\n0\nGood food with excellent service\nOct 2013 • Friends\nWe went to this restaurant in the old quarter with Vietnamese friends with a 1 year old baby. The food and atmosphere were good but the staff were fantastic as the baby didn't want to settle making it difficult for us all to eat together as someone was always chasing him. The staff stepped up and entertained him to give us time to enjoy the meal. Guess you cant guarantee this will happen every time but the food is worth a try anyway!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 23, 2013",
